id: FEND20-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: state_paths
target: crates/web/src/persist.rs
find: install_save_on_leave(key, crate::glue::history_to_save)
replace: host.open_history(&[]); install_save_on_leave(key, crate::glue::history_to_save)
expect-fail: 層全体は_update_を通らない状態の変更を持たない
note: 許可表に無い &mut self のメソッドの呼び出しが保存の層に入る（R3 の許可表）
